MySQLi for mysqlnd with OpenSSL: the module mysqli of php84-mysqli, the
same build, with php84-mysqlnd-openssl instead of php84-mysqlnd. The
same files as php84-mysqli: install one of the two.

The module mysqli of PHP 8.4 for php84 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20240924/mysqli.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php84/conf.d, its
headers in include/php84/php/ext/mysqli.
